    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SARAH: You have an eyelash on your... here...\nSARAH: I can get you out of here. But you have to trust me.\nMARGARET: Everything okay?",
      "MELISSA: I'm a-comin! I still love you most.\nSUSAN: People write stuff on the cards they won't say in a focus group. They get more specific.\nSUSAN: Roger has this advice I always remember.\nSUSAN: Forget about anyone who scores you in the Twos and Threes. They'll never like your show.",
      "SUSAN: They're the one who think your show is almost the best thing they've ever seen. They get your vision. They just want it to be even better.\nMELISSA: Round two is starting without you!\nSUSAN: So you'll look at the cards?",
      "SIERRA: No! No. This isn't a murder. It's an intervention.\nSUSAN: I had to get you away from her. She was holding you back. You had to give her up."
    ]
  },
